  {
    "hotel_id": "779306",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/the-wembley-a-st-giles-hotel-penang/hotel/penang-my.html",
    "name": "St. Giles Wembley Penang",
    "detail": "We found our perfect hideout hotel in penang which is the Wembley! and we even extended our holiday for one more night. We got a deluxe bedroom with king bed. Pro The room is spacious and nice enough for two. We can see the KOMTAR building from our window which is a nice view + I can see the sea and bridge as well which is cool. Got bath tub and shower, and love love the bath shower gel, I love the classic smell of hotel bubble bath that I used to smell when I was young plus with additional green tea smell which is great. Love the chocolate brownies with ice cream, I ordered for the in-dining room service - two nights in a row. that's how good the brownies is. i wish the brownies are bigger tho. yum. oh and the best of all, the omellete i got during breakfast for the first night was awesome. The chef uncle, gave me a lot of cheese as I asked and make it wiggle wiggle . its so good, and it put my faith back in the presence of good omelete. Cons Because the hotel is beside the main road, so sometimes it can be a bit loud- as in you can hear car sounds. not too loud, but its apparent enough. Toilet shower is quite weak. Unless you use the shower in the bath tub, which will then lead to wet floor. My last day of breakfast was spoilt, coz the awesome chef uncle was not there, and the younger replacement really put a downer on my omelete faith. it was quite bad, the eggs not runny, its just not properly cooked, the outside is a bit burnt tho.. lulz. but i guess it depends on your luck, maybe he's learning. I guess having a great omelette really need luck for me. Anyway overall, it was a great stay, and worth my money. Thank you ",
